  "description": "Who says big, intimidating tiger shifters cannot be needy? In Hojun is desperate for warmth, but his unique desires always end in heartbreak. Drunkenly nursing a broken heart with his ears and tail on full display, he expects pity, not passion. But Director Sa Hyeon sees a rare opportunity right in front of him. Striking up a conversation with the vulnerable tiger, Hyeon effortlessly reels him in. One steamy night leads to an unexpected emotional connection, but staying professional at work becomes impossible when body chemistry takes over.\n\n(Source: Lezhin Entertainment)",
